{"schema_version":"benchmark-q1-semantic-issue-coverage-judgment-luna5","question_id":"Q1-semantic-issue-coverage","status":"ok","judge_run_name":"luna8-api-v4-medium-mimo-v26pro-rl-max-full200-n04","prediction_set_name":"mimo-v26pro-rl-max-full200-n04","paper_id":"2501.15976","judge_input_sha256":"94d7f669eed42894d727d7495dd4090900e8261ace7c59ba5edc068b7d1731b2","gold_decisions":[{"gold_issue_id":"2501.15976:I002","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-002","focus_relation":"different_causal_subject","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2501.15976:I002:U002","2501.15976:I002:U005","2501.15976:I002:U007"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-002:U001","ISSUE-002:U008","ISSUE-002:U011"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue concerns noninjective interpolation of the original coarse generators and the resulting dimension and matrix-basis failure. ISSUE-002 instead concerns an understated solution-operator interpolation bound and its dependence on C_sol/k; it does not diagnose redundancy or injectivity of the coarse interpolation map.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2501.15976:I005","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-002","focus_relation":"different_causal_subject","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2501.15976:I005:U002","2501.15976:I005:U003","2501.15976:I005:U008"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-002:U001","ISSUE-002:U007","ISSUE-002:U011"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is the failure of exact reconstruction caused by the truncated projected decomposition and the missing cancellation. ISSUE-002 addresses a different interpolation estimate and solution-regularity factor, without recognizing the decomposition's correction term or exact-sum obligation.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2501.15976:I006","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-002","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2501.15976:I006:U001","2501.15976:I006:U003","2501.15976:I006:U006"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-002:U001","ISSUE-002:U002","ISSUE-002:U011"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue identifies an invocation of an interpolation theorem at m=1 outside its stated m≥2 hypotheses and requires a replacement estimate. ISSUE-002 discusses a valid m=2 application and a missing C_sol/k factor in a different bound; it does not recognize the invalid m=1 hypothesis use.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2501.15976:I008","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-001","focus_relation":"upstream_downstream_only","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2501.15976:I008:U001","2501.15976:I008:U005","2501.15976:I008:U008"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-001:U001","ISSUE-001:U002","ISSUE-001:U006"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is the linear-versus-affine Krylov-space error for a nonzero initial iterate and the resulting invalid application of the convergence theorem. ISSUE-001 only derives and corrects a Lambda versus Lambda-squared factor in a downstream iteration-count bound, without diagnosing the invalid iteration space.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]}],"audit":{"all_gold_ids_decided":true,"all_ranked_candidates_considered":true,"target_type_not_used_for_identity":true,"severity_not_used_for_identity":true,"prediction_reuse_requires_explicit_issue_support":true,"each_gold_credited_at_most_once":true,"combined_entries_are_self_contained_diagnoses":true,"support_limit_three_respected":true}}